SUMMARY:Drunk Opera History: Messiah Sing
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:with Opera Untapped\nJoin Opera Untapped as we turn the New Eng
 land Messiah Sing tradition on its head\, adding the fun back story about 
