DESCRIPTION:Jean-Michel Blais was ready to make an epic. mirador\, the pian
 ist-composer's fourth album\, finds the Montrealer turning his gaze onto a
  wondrous world—exchanging contemporary minimalism for a light and gener
 ous maximalism. It's an odyssey that spans choirs\, strings and the music 
 of the Andes\, from Spanish caves to Estonian forests and all the way back
