DESCRIPTION:Western Massachusetts folk rockers The Nields — sisters Neris
 sa and Katryna Nields — have carved out a singular style that combines p
 op craftsmanship\, folk sensibility\, '60s classic rock\, and '90s alterna
 tive\, always with an intelligent (and often humorous) take on the curve b
 alls life keeps serving up. It's a sound Apple Music describes as “equal
  parts The Beatles\, the Cranberries\, and Joni Mitchell.” With finely t
 uned melodies\, natural exuberance\, 21 albums\, major and independent rec
 ord and publishing deals\, and shows alongside Cake\, 10\,000 Maniacs\, Th
 e Band\, Dar Williams\, Patty Griffin\, James Taylor\, and the Indigo Girl
 s\, The Nields have paid their dues many times over.\nhttps://theparlorroo
